		{
			dependencies: ["133154C8444D452C"]
			description: [
				"The Ring of Seven curses is a wearable item that can be equipped in the Curios ring slot."
				"{image:fzzy_config:textures/gui/sprites/widget/popup/divider.png width:200 height:15 align:center}"
				"Every player can get it in introducing questline."
				"{image:fzzy_config:textures/gui/sprites/widget/popup/divider.png width:200 height:15 align:center}"
				"Once it is put on it cannot be removed. (Can it? hmm)"
				"{image:fzzy_config:textures/gui/sprites/widget/popup/divider.png width:200 height:15 align:center}"
				"Wearing it significantly and permanently changes gameplay to be extremely challenging."
				"{image:fzzy_config:textures/gui/sprites/widget/popup/divider.png width:200 height:15 align:center}"
				"You ean create and use unique relics."
