		{
			dependencies: ["133154C8444D452C"]
			description: [
				"Spellstones are different enough from most other wearables you may discover."
				"{image:fzzy_config:textures/gui/sprites/widget/popup/divider.png width:200 height:15 align:center}"
				"They are the source and vessel of powerful elemental magic bestowing their bearers powers beyond human reach."
				"{image:fzzy_config:textures/gui/sprites/widget/popup/divider.png width:200 height:15 align:center}"
				"In modern times there is no known ways to recreate them - origin of spellstones falls back to the first moments of creation when insane energies were released into the previously cold and dark nothingness."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&5&oInteracting fighting and consuming each other bringing an absolute chaos."
				"&5&oIn that chaos they were born encapsulating it in form stable enough to survive eons."
				"&5&oEons upon eons, until your advent..."
				"{image:fzzy_config:textures/gui/sprites/widget/popup/divider.png width:200 height:15 align:center}"
				"By now it's impossible to come across one naturally."
				"{image:fzzy_config:textures/gui/sprites/widget/popup/divider.png width:200 height:15 align:center}"
				"It seems all of them were located and claimed by some &oancient civilization &rthat now ceised to exist leaving behind only the &oruins &rof their creations."
				"{image:fzzy_config:textures/gui/sprites/widget/popup/divider.png width:200 height:15 align:center}"
				"And among that ruins they lie waiting for some brave explorer like you to harness their power."
			]
			id: "1C5454142117BE3D"
			rewards: [
				{
					id: "7DF6AB0081D29020"
					type: "xp"
					xp: 100
				}
				{
					id: "2DE92D3A1805C917"
					item: "kubejs:coin"
					type: "item"
				}
			]
			shape: "square"
			subtitle: "&8[Click to read]"
			tasks: [{
				id: "347388DA9D6C12A2"
				title: "Okay man"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			x: 3.5d
			y: 3.0d
		}
